## How Big Is a 2 Carat Emerald Cut Diamond?

A [2 carat emerald cut diamond](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-search?shape=emerald&caratMin=1.9&caratMax=2.1&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is approximately **8.5mm × 6.0mm** face-up with a depth around 4.5mm. On a size 6 finger, this is half the finger width in length (8.5mm against a 16mm finger) and visible from across a room.

The 2ct emerald cut measures longer than a 2ct round brilliant (round is 8.2mm diameter). It appears more dramatic because of the length. The width (6.0mm) is narrower than the round's 8.2mm, but the elongation makes the ring feel larger.

How big is a 2 carat emerald cut diamond on the hand? On most finger sizes, a 2ct emerald cut is clearly a statement stone. It's the most requested carat weight for this shape.

Full 2ct pricing and analysis at the [2 carat emerald cut diamond guide](/2-carat-emerald-cut-diamond).

**How many mm is a 2 carat emerald cut diamond?** Approximately 8.5mm in length and 6.0mm in width. The exact measurement depends on the depth percentage and L:W ratio of the specific stone. [Search 2ct emerald cuts](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-search?shape=emerald&caratMin=1.9&caratMax=2.1&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) and sort by table size or use the seller's listed dimensions to find the specific face-up spread.

