## How Big Is a 2.5 Carat Emerald Cut Diamond?

A [2.5 carat emerald cut diamond](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-search?shape=emerald&caratMin=2.4&caratMax=2.6&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is approximately **9.0mm × 6.5mm** face-up. The 2.5ct sits between the 2ct and 3ct in both dimensions.

The 2.5ct is a practical size for buyers who want more than 2ct but not the full price jump to 3ct. The 0.5ct difference from 2ct adds about 0.5mm in each dimension — a visible but subtle change. The 0.5ct difference from 3ct means the stone is shorter by about 0.5mm and narrower by about 0.5mm.

