## How Big Is a 4 Carat Emerald Cut Diamond?

A [4 carat emerald cut diamond](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-search?shape=emerald&caratMin=3.9&caratMax=4.1&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is approximately **10.5mm × 7.8mm** face-up. On a size 6 finger, the 4ct emerald cut covers about 65% of the finger width in its length dimension. It is a large, prominent stone by any standard.

The 4ct emerald cut is approximately 1cm in length — a measurement that is easy to visualize against a fingertip. The 10.5mm length is roughly the width of a standard pinky fingernail. At this size, the step-cut facets create large, slow reflections that make the stone look like a polished mirror.

Full 4ct analysis at [4 carat emerald cut diamond ring](/4-carat-emerald-cut-diamond-ring).

