## How Big Is a 5 Carat Emerald Cut Diamond?

A [5 carat emerald cut diamond](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-search?shape=emerald&caratMin=4.9&caratMax=5.1&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) is approximately **11.5mm × 8.5mm** face-up. This is approaching a centimeter and a half in the longest dimension.

At 11.5mm length, the 5ct emerald cut is visually close to the width of a size 6 finger (16mm). The stone fills the hand from most viewing angles. At this size, the step-cut facets create reflections that span nearly the entire stone face, making the hall-of-mirrors effect more dramatic than at smaller sizes.

Full 5ct guide at [5 carat emerald cut diamond ring](/5-carat-emerald-cut-diamond-ring).

